                     PART 2
                ====================================== -->
<section class="chapter" id="part2">
<span class="part-heading">
                        Part 2
                    </span>
<h2>
                        Types of Input and Output Devices
                    </h2>
<p>
                        Hardware devices can be classified
                        according to whether they provide
                        input, produce output, or perform
                        both functions.
                    </p>
</section>
