<section class="chapter" id="section6-5">
<h2>6.5 Bluetooth Interface</h2>
<p>
                        Bluetooth is a short-range wireless technology
                        that allows compatible devices to exchange information.
                    </p>
<h3>Examples</h3>
<ul>
<li>Wireless headphones</li>
<li>Bluetooth keyboards</li>
<li>Wireless mice</li>
<li>Speakers</li>
</ul>
</section>
<!-- =====================================
                     SECTION 6.6
