<section class="chapter" id="section6-6">
<h2>6.6 Network Interface</h2>
<p>
                        A network interface allows a computer to communicate
                        with other devices through wired or wireless networks.
                    </p>
<ul>
<li>
<strong>Ethernet:</strong>
